31:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)] pt-3 text-xs leading-5","children":"Headline population uses the separately reviewed population source, date and boundary shown above. Historical snapshots underpin other indicators; their denominators retain their original dates. Climate uses NASA POWER; local map counts use OpenStreetMap. World Bank indicators provide national context. Scores are LandingPoint calculations, not official ratings. Only eligible metrics contribute to rankings; immigration guidance is not scored. Each observation has its own date and geographic scope. Local rent references are not guaranteed prices, and scores do not establish neighborhood safety or personal visa eligibility."}]
